---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/prose.css';

/**
 * A /now page: what is true this month, dated so a reader can tell how stale it is.
 * Update the date whenever you update the content, or do not bother having the page.
 */
const updated = new Date('2026-08-16');
const long = updated.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
  day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric',
});
---
<Base title="Now" description="What Ali Alp Özer is working on this month.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="label">Now</p>
      <h1>What I am working on this month.</h1>
      <p class="stamp">
        Last updated <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{long}</time>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        <strong>Building <a href="/work/advocate">Advocate's</a> evidence-grounding layer.</strong>
        The graph that finds and scores postings works. What I am building now is the part
        that makes the generator structurally unable to invent a fact: it may only select
        claim IDs from a graded store and write the prose between them.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Starting the MSc at TUM in October.</strong> Sorting out the practical side
        of moving to Munich properly, and reading ahead so the first semester is not a
        standing start.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Fine-tuning, the last block.</strong> Final section of the sixteen-week
        program I have been running since June. It is the block I have been least comfortable
        with, which is presumably why it is worth doing.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Writing more.</strong> I have been building considerably faster than I have
        been writing it down, and the writing is what makes any of it useful to someone else.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <p class="foot">
        This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="noopener">now page</a>. If it is
        badly out of date, that is a fair thing to hold against me.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-block: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-lg); }
  .page-head .label { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .stamp {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .prose { padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl); }
  .prose .foot { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--ink-faint); }
</style>
